xarif build: finish the OIDC sign-in instead of reporting "Could not reach the server".

Why: POST /api/v3/auth/oidc/exchange answers the user object itself
(server/auth/src/routes/federated.rs:275; server/tests/server/auth_federated.rs:418
pins that shape), but the callback page reads `data.user`. The undefined
read throws, the catch treats a non-ApiError as a network failure, and a
sign-in that succeeded (session cookie set, user created) ends on "Could not
reach the server." Measured on music.xarif.de 2026-10-24: exchange 200,
then the error page.

Fix: accept both shapes. svelte-check 0 errors, prettier and eslint clean.

Remove when: upstream's callback page reads the exchange answer it gets.

